<description>&lt;p&gt;Violence has intensified with Sudan allegedly using drones that caused the majority of war deaths this year, while South Sudan accuses Sudan of a drone strike that killed scores in a disputed area. The government is investigating a killing of nearly 200 people in Ruweng and has warned UK citizens against travel to the country. Elections have been postponed again to February 2027, and a revenge attack killed 17 people, while a Juba League activist was beaten to death in a mob linked to a local leader's murder. A lawmaker said women are fighting for rights, not punching men, and cattle-related clashes in Mundri have raised the death toll to 22. According to UCDP, there were 2 battle-related deaths in 2024.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxNUzVVZlh0cUIxWFBYU2NGYnZWdHZmc1RLY3oyNm51NTlQQjJEMFlVclNsN2tWM0FjMmRycVdsMXQ2WW4xeUJZYVR1V3lac2ZBTmJ4RWcxYXVxaFlGV1dNbXM3OG5FOXhheVdiM0dzUVktZnJZZkQxNUU4ZWZuM0lWV2JyZXVKUXZtcDl2RHVaTVRtRGN1ZFdPckdPQ0dZSFI1SDVfVGlPbWhYa0o0alNCNFdsSDgtUkhxakRWZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxQeUIwQ3YwYU80MXZ3cXJYRXBSckd3YUhZWFRXZi1NaVBQTkdtZmNENW90VVJyZlMwd0VNT0VKZU45alVZM25Pc3JFek5icXFiLVBBYmRuSmxLSjJldmMzbm9FeUhhX0UyUjJneF9FNm5HT0JVbFFRVDZGblhCUWd6am81WndvQlNvdGNoUHJHQU5YbmdBYkdHYk5R?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sudans Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Lufkin Daily News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxONFRYSUk2SE44NXlFS0xYWm5BY0ExeE1iclByTXBIUGJ6ZkdNeDVBYzN3UlNZZlQ1dURHWVZwV05JWHl4d0J4dy1aNFNTaURvTFQxTHhhbnVJZ2kzTXZtbjlnaDVxd1JKS2FaVWVPc2haeXk3dXd4TmtMZmozVXk2dWh3TkFEZw?oc=5